  "text": "Task 108 Review: Code changes align perfectly with approved spec/plan/tasks. All modifications are within scope:\n\n1. **Permission field changes**: Changed `allowed-tools:` (YAML list) to `tools:` (inline format) in all 8 agents - exactly as specified in plan\n2. **Development Context section**: Added to all 8 agents - matches plan specification precisely\n3. **Guidelines-reviewer scope validation**: Added per plan requirement FR-012\n4. **Dead-code-detector spec awareness**: Added per plan requirement FR-013\n5. **Prepare-completion.md updates**: Modified agent prompts to pass spec path, validation status, and diff target - matches plan FR-014/FR-015\n6. **Backlog entry**: Added new item about specify command improvements (out of scope for this task, appropriately added to backlog)\n7. **CLAUDE.md**: Updated Active Task reference to new spec 108 (expected update)\n\nNo violations found. Code review is straightforward - changes are configuration updates (YAML/Markdown), not logic changes. All modifications directly address requirements in spec.md/plan.md/tasks.md.",
